        "id": 18338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-08-06T00:32:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I used days as it seemed to be the standard unit for this type of feature. I\u0027m not sure hours would be a big enough deterrent. However, we could always change this later on should operators have a valid use case requiring more flexibility.",
      "parentUuid": "bacf61ea_794c1e9e",
