      "writtenOn": "2016-08-08T16:20:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess one thing we can consider as a benefit here is that we advertise the ability for the user to contact an administrator - which can ultimately override this check. So, in the event a user *really* needs to reset their password, they can always do so through an admin (versus requiring the granularity of hours).",
      "parentUuid": "bacf61ea_d23cff30",
